    "hero.role": "Business intelligence and data analysis of the car industry",
    "hero.lead": "I turn the open microdata of Spain’s traffic authority (DGT) and the European Environment Agency into interactive dashboards on new vehicle registrations, the vehicle fleet, the used-car market and CO₂ emissions, with a close eye on the rise of the electric car.",
    "hero.cred": "I work as a business intelligence systems specialist for the Government of Navarre and I am an associate lecturer at the Public University of Navarre.",
    "hero.ctaDash": "See the dashboards",
    "hero.ctaContact": "Get in touch",
    "hero.socialAria": "Profiles",
    "hero.shotAlt": "Front page of the dashboard on new car and SUV registrations in Spain between 2015 and 2025, showing the trend in sales, leasing, average CO₂ emissions, powertrain types and the electric share",
    "hero.figcaption": "<strong>New car and SUV registrations</strong> The most visited dashboard of the project, built on DGT microdata updated every month. Together, my dashboards have more than 15,000 views on Tableau Public. <a href=\"#matriculaciones-turismos\">Open this dashboard</a>",
    "about.portraitAlt": "Photo of Asier Lizarraga",
    "about.title": "Data, data analytics and dashboards",
    "about.p1": "I hold a degree in computer engineering from the Public University of Navarre (2010) and I have specialised in data mining and business intelligence. I currently work as a systems specialist at the <strong>Digital Progress Service of the Government of Navarre</strong>, where I build and run BI projects on the Microsoft platform (Integration Services, Analysis Services with OLAP cubes and Reporting Services) and with <strong>Tableau</strong>.",
    "about.p2": "Since 2022 I have also been an <strong>associate lecturer</strong> in the Department of Statistics, Computer Science and Mathematics at the <a href=\"https://www.unavarra.es/pdi/?uid=812558&amp;dato=descripcion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Public University of Navarre (UPNA)</a>, in the Computer Science and Artificial Intelligence area, where I teach the Databases I lab sessions.",
    "about.p3": "My background combines intelligent data analysis and finance: I hold a master’s degree in Soft Computing and Intelligent Data Analysis and another in International Financial Markets. Before that I worked on marketing analytics and machine learning projects, and on systems that generate trading rules.",
    "about.p4": "Outside work I am interested in electric cars and renewable energy, a subject that lies behind much of the analysis on this site.",
    "about.skillsTitle": "Skills",
    "about.skills": "<li>Tableau</li> <li>Microsoft BI: SSIS, SSAS and SSRS</li> <li>OLAP cubes</li> <li>Databases and SQL</li> <li>Data mining</li> <li>Machine learning</li> <li>Big data</li> <li>Forecasting</li>",
    "about.jobsTitle": "Career",
    "about.jobs": "<li> <span class=\"cv__when\">Present</span> <div class=\"cv__what\"> <strong>Business intelligence systems specialist</strong> <span>Digital Progress Service, Government of Navarre</span> </div> </li> <li> <span class=\"cv__when\">2022–today</span> <div class=\"cv__what\"> <strong>Associate lecturer in Databases I</strong> <span>Department of Statistics, Computer Science and Mathematics, Public University of Navarre</span> <a class=\"cv__link\" href=\"https://www.unavarra.es/pdi/?uid=812558&amp;dato=descripcion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Profile at UPNA</a> </div> </li> <li> <span class=\"cv__when\">2014–2017</span> <div class=\"cv__what\"> <strong>Trading rule generation systems</strong> <span>Actiotrade (startup)</span> </div> </li> <li> <span class=\"cv__when\">2011–2012</span> <div class=\"cv__what\"> <strong>Marketing analytics and machine learning</strong> <span>Cognodata Consulting</span> </div> </li>",
    "about.studiesTitle": "Education",
    "about.studies": "<li> <span class=\"cv__when\">2014</span> <div class=\"cv__what\"> <strong>Master’s degree in International Financial Markets</strong> <span>UNED</span> </div> </li> <li> <span class=\"cv__when\">2011</span> <div class=\"cv__what\"> <strong>Master’s degree in Soft Computing and Intelligent Data Analysis</strong> <span>University of Oviedo and European Centre for Soft Computing</span> </div> </li> <li> <span class=\"cv__when\">2010</span> <div class=\"cv__what\"> <strong>Degree in Computer Engineering</strong> <span>Public University of Navarre</span> </div> </li>",
    "project.title": "Analysis of the car industry in Spain",
    "project.lead": "A graphical, iterative analysis of the Spanish car industry: new vehicle registrations, the vehicle fleet and ownership transfers in the used-car market, rounded off with the CO₂ emissions of new cars across Europe. Everything is built on official microdata from the Spanish traffic authority (DGT) and the European Environment Agency (EEA), and is updated whenever new data is released.",
