    "d2.lead": "The companion to the previous dashboard: it analyses sales of new vehicles that are neither cars nor SUVs —buses, motorcycles, lorries, vans and so on— since 2015. It keeps the same structure: a front page with the market overview and six thematic dashboards, with a filter by vehicle type.",
